          "y_start": 380.0,
          "page_start": 1,
          "page_end": 1,
          "text_before_clauses": "Any amount withdrawn or transferred from the aforesaid accounts at the time of closure or otherwise shall be charged to tax in the year in which the amount is transferred or withdrawn as per the provisions of the Schedule X.",
